{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411170","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341117001:1":{"text":"에취... 에취... 에... 취!!","source_cn":"阿嚏……阿嚏……阿……嚏！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B0ECCCC909D81E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341117002:1":{"text":"치피, 또 꽃가루 알레르기야? 지난번에 특효약 만들어줬잖아.","source_cn":"满满，你又花粉过敏了？上次不是给你调配了一些特效药吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA169521D53F67F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341117003:1":{"text":"맞아, 분명 약을 썼는데도 계속... 에취! 코가 너무 간질간질하네! 재채기가 안 멈춰!","source_cn":"是呀，满满明明已经用过药了，但还是……阿嚏，不停打喷嚏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B03EE53FF147EBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341117004:1":{"text":"이상하네? 특효약이 갑자기 안 듣다니... 어디 보자...","source_cn":"奇怪，特效药怎么会突然失效呢？让我看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4527D9FE0601410D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341117005:1":{"text":"바보 치피, 꽃가루 때문이 아니잖아! 딱정벌레가 네 코 위에 앉아 있네!","source_cn":"笨满满，这根本不是花粉的问题！是一只花斑瓢虫爬到你鼻子上了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9DA13AC88B88E4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title